//This file only contains strings relevant to the installation of the mod

@-1004="PLEASE report the error message in the file"

@101500=~Chriz Item Randomiser: randomises items anew for each new adventure (requires EEex with LuaJIT)~
@101501=~This component requires Enhanced Edition Trilogy (EET).~
@101502=~This component requires EEex. Please install EEex first.~
@101503=~Chriz Item Randomiser cannot be combined with Item Randomiser's randomisation (Mode 1 or Mode 2).~
@101504=~Chriz Item Randomiser cannot be combined with Item Randomiser's "More Spell Shield scrolls"; its configurator offers that option for each adventure.~
@101505=~Another copy of this randomiser's runtime (override/M_FLPR.lua) is installed, for example Item Randomiser's component 1500. Please uninstall it before installing this component.~
@101510=~This component requires the EEex LuaJIT component: InfinityLoader.ini must contain exactly one LuaPatchMode line, LuaPatchMode=REPLACE_INTERNAL_WITH_EXTERNAL. Installation stopped.~
@101512=~UI.MENU has no single-player New Game call (startEngine:OnNewGameButtonClick) or character acceptance call (createCharScreen:AcceptCharacter) in a form this component can hook, or it already calls FLPRUI_ functions. Installation stopped.~
@101513=~BALDUR.GAM is missing or is not a GAMEV2.0 new-game template. Installation stopped.~
@101514=~BALDUR.GAM already defines the global FLPR_FRESH more than once or with a value other than 1. Installation stopped.~
@101515=~UI.MENU defines startEngine:OnNewGameButtonClick or createCharScreen:AcceptCharacter itself; this component can only hook calls to them. Installation stopped.~
@101520=~Note: Chriz Item Randomiser cannot prepare %flir_cp_name%, because %flir_cp_reason%. It stays as installed, and the configurator will not offer what depends on it.~
@101521=~the game has no such file~
@101522=~it already contains changes from an earlier version of this randomiser~
@101523=~it no longer gives the reward~
@101524=~it gives the reward more than once~
@101525=~it gives the reward in an unexpected way~
@101526=~it no longer takes the quest item~
@101527=~its journal entries have an unexpected form~
@101528=~the conversation has an unexpected form~
